    fees and are your responsibility unless expressly agreed otherwise in writing.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Client responsibilities</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Provide timely access to accounts, assets, approvals and information we reasonably need.</li>
    <li>Ensure all materials you supply are accurate and that you hold the rights to use them.</li>
    <li>Ensure your products, services and claims comply with applicable law and platform policies.</li>
